Tarv of the Rising Moon is a character of [[Geography/Syrin (Locality)|Syrin]] media, and the look most often worn at [[Geography/Syrin (Locality)/Terminus|Media Con]], where crowds dress as him. He has two metal arms that unfold into machine guns, and a leather jacket with a moon across the back.

In the first comics Tarv is a worker raising one of [[Org/Omnivox/index|Omnivox]]'s towers in Terminus. A crane tears off both his arms, the company refuses his claim and lays him off, and he falls into the slums, where a ripper who had lost his license fits him with prototype arms. His early adventures are against Omnivox itself. Omnivox later bought the character and rewrote him as one of its heroes, a change the older readers still complain about.
